  "instructions": [
    "Heat 1tbsp of vegetable oil in a wok over medium heat.",
    "Add the ginger paste and stir-fry for 1 minute.",
    "Add the lemongrass, galangal, and garlic, and stir-fry for another minute.",
    "Add the bamboo shoots and chilies, and stir-fry for 2-3 minutes.",
    "Add the fish sauce, soy sauce, and brown sugar, and stir-fry for 1 minute.",
    "Add the toasted peanuts and bean sprouts, and stir-fry for another minute.",
